  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The starting alloy is Al0.2Co1.5CrFeNi1.5Ti0.3 with a homogeneous FCC matrix and uniform elemental distribution.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Oxidizing exposure selectively oxidizes Cr in the starting alloy.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11169556::web::002::introduction",
        "PMC11169556::web::019::results_and_discussion",
        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ti and minor Al may support the selective oxidation and scale-forming process.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11169556::web::019::results_and_discussion",
        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Selective oxidation produces a duplex scale consisting of an inner continuous Cr-rich oxide and an outer mixed, less protective oxide.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11169556::web::002::introduction",
        "PMC11169556::web::019::results_and_discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The duplex oxide structure governs degradation under oxidizing conditions.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "A reducing atmosphere suppresses selective oxidation and minimizes duplex-scale formation.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Suppressing oxidation in a reducing atmosphere preserves a homogeneous FCC matrix.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Differential oxidation kinetics and elemental diffusivity drive selective oxidation and elemental partitioning.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11169556::web::002::introduction",
        "PMC11169556::web::019::results_and_discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preferential Cr oxidation forms a protective inner oxide layer.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11169556::web::002::introduction",
        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The remaining alloying elements form a secondary, less adherent outer oxide.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11169556::web::002::introduction",
        "PMC11169556::web::019::results_and_discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The layered scale modulates the degradation rate.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The FCC matrix remains intact during short-term oxidizing exposure.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11169556::web::019::results_and_discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Long-term degradation occurs if the oxide scale spalls or becomes porous.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11169556::web::002::introduction",
        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Oxidizing exposure will cause early and progressive Cr segregation, with traces of Ti and Al, at the metal/oxide interface.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11169556::web::002::introduction",
        "PMC11169556::web::019::results_and_discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reducing exposure will produce minimal oxide-scale development and retain a relatively uniform elemental distribution.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Duplex-scale formation under oxidizing conditions will correlate with increased weight gain and oxide thickness relative to the as-manufactured baseline.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed comparison uses oxidizing and reducing gases near 900 °C, sampled from minutes to 120 hours.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11169556::web::002::introduction",
        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The hypothesis applies from at least 500 °C to approximately 900 °C while exposure durations remain insufficient to cause bulk phase transformations.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11169556::web::002::introduction",
        "PMC13208696::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Outside the stated temperature or time limits, competing degradation mechanisms may operate.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
